    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi enehu mwadzifundza kula kpwehu vira ambavyo mnalondwa muishi, ili kumuhamira Mlungu. Na kpwa sababu hu afuasi amwenga a Bwana Jesu, hunakuvoyani na kukukanyani muenderere kuhenda manono zaidi na zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mnamanya gara malagizo hurigokuphani kpwa uwezo wa Bwana Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu anakulondani muishi bila lawama. Kpwa hivyo msikale azembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mlume analondwa amanye vira anavyoweza kuzuwiya mwiriwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana yanjina ni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chila mlume analondwa amanye vira ndivyoishi na mchewe kpwa ishima.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni lazima kuishi maisha ga ishima, maisha gasigo lawama ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wala tamaa mbii dza atu asio na dini, au asiommanya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mutu naasimkosere myawe hata chidide kuhusu dzambo hiri. Mana hwakuambirani kare na huchikukanyani kukala Bwana Jesu andaatiya adabu kali ahendao mambo higo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu wahuiha husagale masagazi gasigo lawama, wala si masagazi ga uzindzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo anayebera mafundzo higa kamʼbera mutu, ela anamʼbera Mlungu ambaye anakuphani Roho Mtakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, takuna haja ya kukuandikirani kuhusu kumendza afuasi ayawenu. Mana mwimwi enye mwafundzwa ni Mlungu kala ni lazima mmendzane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi munamendza afuasi ayawenu osi hiko tsi ya Yunani, seemu ya Makedonia. Phahi enehu hunakuvoyani muenderere vivyo zaidi na zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nia yenu naikale kusagala masagazi gasigo hoyo na mutu. Tsona chila mutu naashuulikiye mamboge na ahende kazi na mikonoye dza hurivyokulagizani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchihenda hivyo mundaishimiwa ni atu asiomkuluphira Jesu, na tamundakala na lazima ya kuadamira atu anjina kpwa maitaji genu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, hunalonda mmanye ukpweli kuhusu afuasi a Jesu ariofwa, ili msisononeke dza atu asioamini kukala andafufuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swiswi hunaamini kukala Jesu wafwa na achifufuka. Kpwa hivyo naswi hunaamini piya kukala, Mlungu andaareha phamwenga na Jesu atu osi ariofwa kuno anamuamini Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
